{
  "info": {
    "name": "OIPP API",
    "description": "Every endpoint in CLAUDE.md §6, plus the TC-SEC security checks from Test Plan §5.1.\n\n1. `npm run seed`, then `npm run dev` (API on http://localhost:5000).\n2. Run **0. Auth** first: the login requests save `studentToken`, `student2Token` and `adminToken`.\n3. Run the folders in order, or the whole collection with the Collection Runner. Create requests save the ids that later requests use.\n\nSeed logins: admin@oipp.test / Admin@12345 · ravi@oipp.test, asha@oipp.test / Student@123.\nLogin and register share a limit of 20 requests per 15 minutes per IP, so re-running the whole collection many times in a row returns 429.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
